WEBVTT

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.330
The extraterrestrial life-form, EI-01...

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:20.790
2 Years Ago

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.950
...reeling from an attack by Galeon...

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.660
...crash-lands in Tokyo.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.330
His survival power is so great that he is able to absorb...

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.420
...all of the machines within his reach.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.760
Nimbly evading his pursuers, he then vanishes into thin air.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.890
Japanese Government Top-Secret Meeting

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.850
Realizing the enormity of the situation, the Japanese government...

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.350
...establishes a defense organization to counter the extraterrestrial threat.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:52.900
Namely, the Gutsy Geoid Guard, also known as GGG!

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:00.660
But it is around the same time that EI-01 begins his invasion of the...

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.750
...vast Tokyo underworld...

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:07.160
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:10.060
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:21.060
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:27.780
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:32.060
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:36.980
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.900
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.700
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.460
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.460
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.630
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.170
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:01.300
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.260
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:08.340
Dividing Driver!

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:15.980
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:21.860
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.810
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:28.700
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.630
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.920
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:36.130
The Holy Left Arm

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.010
<i>The Holy Left Arm</i>

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.180
Embroiled in a plot devised by an extraterrestrial life-form...

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:48.310
A pro wrestler, Death Bomber, has been transformed into a mechanoid.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.310
Overcoming the glitches in the transformation software...

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.320
...GaoGaiGar is able to successfully achieve Final Fusion...

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.280
...and smashes the enemy robot to pieces.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.410
He then claws out the robot's core containing Death Bomber...

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:06.160
...but by this time, Gai has lost all self-control.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.960
Curatio...

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:13.330
...teneritas, sectio...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:17.340
...salus, coctura!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.520
Thank you...

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.230
Thank you! Thank you!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:41.280
So there was another human being inside EI-03's core after all.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.870
Entohji! Don't let him get away this time.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.250
You...

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.760
Wait, come back!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.230
Gai! Don't overdo it.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.530
Hey! What's wrong, Gai?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.450
All of Gai's functions are dead!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.490
The backups aren't kicking in!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.580
Gai could be killed...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.620
He's going to die!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.540
Now, now. No need to panic.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.460
That boy's always been a tough one.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.050
Ushi, where's the maintenance vehicle?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.550
It'll be here in 30 seconds.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.350
Right, let's get him back to base right away!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.680
Gai...

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.100
Entohji, what's the status on that boy?

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.560
Looks good.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:05:00.360
I've entered those unique energy waves he emits into the computer...

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:04.450
...so no matter how fast he flies, we can track him by residual energy.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:21.630
Yet another mysterious robot has been destroyed by...

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.460
...a government defense organization.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.050
The government has declined to elaborate on this organization...

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:30.390
...saying that any announcement would be premature.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.560
But why can't they talk about it?

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.020
Mysterious Robot
Defeats Mecha-Monster!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.390
I guess it's because they don't want the guys who built that robot to...

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.650
...get any information about the defense organization.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.610
Isn't this frightening?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.070
Hmmm?

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.120
That black robot...

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.450
So it belongs to the government!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.040
What?

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.300
We've confirmed our target.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.350
We're bringing him in now.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.490
This way!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.520
What just happened?

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.900
Augh! Hey, let me go!

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.110
We're not going to hurt you.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.490
What do you want with me?

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.620
We came here to protect you.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.990
You're lying! You let me go!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:20.120
Help! Dad! Mom!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.420
No!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.310
Huh? You...

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.430
You know me?

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.810
Did you come to pick me up?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.650
Where are you taking me?

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.220
What the...

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.600
What the heck. He's just an ordinary human being after all!

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:26.520
And like the other man, he has no memory of being inside the robot.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.440
There's no useful data here, really...

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:32.070
Still, just a few hours ago, this man was a pro wrestler...

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.740
So what made him...

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:40.580
Galeon has returned! He's got the boy with him!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.910
What?

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.480
Can you tell us your name, son?

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.900
I want you to know that you can trust us.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.650
You have nothing to worry about!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.070
My boy, this happens to be the secret base station of a...

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:18.950
...defense organization under the government's direct supervision!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.160
Secret base station?

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.710
Yes! That's the truth!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:30.460
We want you to tell us about your mysterious power, that's all!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.720
So we'd really like you to come out from there... please!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:48.810
Are you telling me to go out there now?

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.170
Penchinon!

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:18.300
I never expected you to waste that precious Zonder Metal!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.180
My sincerest apologies.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:27.890
That black robot was far more powerful than I anticipated...

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:32.980
I have a splendid idea, Lord Pasdar.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.950
Oh? Then let's hear it, Polonaise.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:43.120
Why not send a Zonder Robo on a rampage in a densely populated area?

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:48.410
Do you think the black robot can fight with civilian lives at risk?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.380
I like it.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.210
I'm leaving it in your hands, Polonaise.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:03.140
My lord!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.070
Locomotive Park

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.280
Train departing!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:24.370
Choo-choo! Chug-chug-chug!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:29.290
Choo-choo! Chug-chug-chug!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:37.380
Lucky you, you look so strong...

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.300
Man, I'm so tired of living this life.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.100
Good evening to you.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.450
How's he doing, Mikoto?

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.040
Professor!

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.830
The readings for his vital signs have never left the red zone...

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.580
Oh, well, he'll be back on his feet in no time!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.670
You shouldn't have let him fight in that condition!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.340
Aren't you the least bit worried about Gai?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.760
Tell me... what father doesn't worry about his own child?

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:30.060
By rights, Gai should've died two years ago, Mikoto.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:36.860
But here he is living on as a cyborg. That's enough to make me happy.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:41.110
And that's why I want him to do whatever he wants.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:45.160
It was Gai's own choice to go into battle against the enemy.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:49.330
As his father, all I can do for him is support him and watch over him.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:55.710
I'm sorry, I didn't mean...

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.000
No need to be sorry.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:05.050
I know Gai can fight without fear because he has you, Mikoto.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.800
Professor...

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:14.690
Mysterious Robot
Defeats Mecha-Monster!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:12.060
Little girl, can you tell us what the robot was like?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.020
Hey, crying's not going to help us, kid!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.440
Yes, I see.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.570
Please take good care of him.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.360
Right, goodbye then.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.250
Swan, what's the story on this boy?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.630
He's unmistakably human.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.470
Mamoru, thanks for cooperating with us.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.140
Hope you don't mind, but we need you for just a while longer.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.470
Um, do my parents know?

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.060
Don't worry.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:56.940
We told them police are questioning you as an eyewitness to the robot.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:00.690
We let your mother know that we'll be driving you home afterwards.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.610
I see...

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.460
The surveillance system has spotted a runaway locomotive.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.460
It's moving along the Tokaido Line.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:22.840
There's no question that it's EI-04!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.380
Professor! How is Gai?

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:25.880
I'm afraid I can't rouse him now.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.430
It'll take at least 12 hours for him to accept the replacement parts...

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:32.350
...and neutralize all the foreign-body reactions.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.020
Unfortunately that's the best we can do with bionic technology today.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:48.820
Oh! I'm so sorry...

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.990
Hey, little boy!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:14.970
Gai!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.060
So it's you...

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.430
Waha!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.890
Oh! It's a miracle!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:24.110
All of Gai's functions are back to normal now!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:24.900
What?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:29.860
Holy smokes! This technology is far beyond mankind's capabilities!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.160
Is it okay for you to get up, Mister?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.740
Drop the Mister business.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.660
I'm still only 20, you know!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:44.080
There it is!

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.350
Gai! We're counting on you!

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:56.930
Don't let that train into the city!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.220
Roger!

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:00.230
Here I come, locomotive!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.440
Stop!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.740
I have a favor to ask!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.240
You can't come in here unless you're authorized!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:17.080
Please, I want you to take me to the battle!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.750
Now don't be ridiculous.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:31.470
Choo-choo! Chug-chug...

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:40.100
Galeon!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.030
Fusion!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.080
GaiGar!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.290
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:08.460
Roger!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.960
Final Fusion...

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.380
Program Drive!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:19.720
Final Fusion!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:12.070
GaoGaiGar!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.110
Final Fusion, complete!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.780
Yay!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.580
Protect Shade!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:33.630
No!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.890
GaoGaiGar's armor can't withstand much more!

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:49.440
Chief! We can't put up a full-on fight like this!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.610
Then we have no choice!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.030
Prepare to launch the Dividing Driver!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:58.900
Huh?

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.280
Oh, no!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:01.740
But if it fails...

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.410
...the city will be destroyed!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.290
It'll be destroyed even if we don't launch it!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.330
Gai's pulled off so many miracles so far, he can do it again!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.500
And why can he do that?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.590
Because he's a hero!

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:21.090
Dividing Driver, launch!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.760
Roger!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.640
Dividing Driver, all set to go!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.680
Opening the Mirror Catapult!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.270
Locking down coordinates, okay!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.820
Commencing Mirror Coating!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.570
Launch!

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.710
Gai, lock your position for alignment!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.670
I thought you'd never ask!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:15.150
Dividing Driver!

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.880
Arresting Field, locked down!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.840
Repression Field, stabilized!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.010
Property damage, zero!

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.010
Dividing core, vanished!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.180
Battlefield creation successful!

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.600
GaoGaiGar, exiting DD Mode.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.690
Now engaging Battle Mode!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.520
All right!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.020
Let's go!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.610
Bring it, EI-04!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:49.240
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.120
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo!

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.520
No, stop!

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:25.360
You can't crush that!

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:28.910
Don't worry, I told him to bring that core back with him.

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:29.990
That's not it!

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:30.780
Huh?

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:32.450
It's no good...

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:34.950
It's not going to work that way...

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:40.830
What the?

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.350
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.220
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:01.400
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:06.190
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:17.290
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:24.050
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:28.710
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.050
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.950
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:47.690
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:51.450
The enemy robot has been knocked out, but the Zonder escapes.

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:53.870
Use all your resources to find him, GGG!

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:58.120
But the Zonder takes off in the most powerful space shuttle on Earth!

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.120
Shoot him down, GaoGaiGar!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.960
Dividing Driver, split the ocean!

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:05.960
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.380
"The Fugitive Zonder"

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
The Fugitive Zonder

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:10.380
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.430
Will Knife

00:24:12.590 --> 00:24:14.590
This is the Key to Victory!
